SUMMARY:Peter Antoniou LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nPeter Antoniou is a rising star in the world of stand-up comedy\, known for his explosive energy\, razor-sharp wit\, and fearlessly honest material. The Australian-born comedian has quickly made a name for himself on the international comedy circuit\, winning over audiences with his unique perspective on culture\, identity\, and the absurdities of everyday life. \nAntoniou’s comedy is bold\, fast-paced\, and deeply personal. He draws from his multicultural background and life experiences to craft material that is both hilarious and surprisingly insightful. His performances are known for their intensity and authenticity — he holds nothing back on stage\, and audiences love him for it. \nHaving toured extensively across Australia\, the UK\, and North America\, Peter Antoniou is building a reputation as one of the most exciting live performers in comedy today. His Philadelphia debut at Punch Line Philly is not to be missed. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM EDT \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restriction: 21+ with 2-beverage minimum \nTicket Prices: Starting from $27 (plus fees) \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Philly is the crown jewel of Philadelphia’s comedy scene\, located at 33 E. Laurel Street in the Northern Liberties neighborhood. With a capacity of approximately 300 guests\, the club offers an intimate setting where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue boasts a full bar\, comfortable table seating\, and a vibrant atmosphere that gets the crowd energized before the first comedian even takes the mic. The sound system and lighting are top-notch\, ensuring a professional\, polished show experience every time. \nPunch Line Philly is accessible by public transit and has parking available in nearby garages and lots. Doors open 30–45 minutes before showtime — plan to arrive early to grab your drinks and find your seats before the show begins. \nWhat to Expect\nPeter Antoniou brings an electric\, high-octane energy to the stage that is impossible to ignore. His set is a whirlwind of sharp observations\, personal stories\, and fearless comedy that keeps the audience on the edge of their seats — and in stitches throughout. \nThe evening will feature an opening act followed by Peter Antoniou’s full headlining performance. Whether you’re already a fan or experiencing his comedy for the first time\, this is a show that will leave a lasting impression. \nThis is a 21+ event with a two-beverage minimum. Tickets are on sale now — grab yours before this intimate show sells out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $27 – $60 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Don’t miss out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/peter-antoniou-live-at-punch-line-philly/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 19123\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/64b89f6b-7647-4700-96d0-88a094e6b84d_EVENT_DETAIL_PAGE_16_9-o7I1c0.jpg
