SUMMARY:Colum Tyrrell LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club - Sacramento
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nColum Tyrrell LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nIrish comedian Colum Tyrrell brings his sharp wit and engaging storytelling to Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento on August 16\, 2026! Known for his clever observations and unique comedic perspective\, Colum Tyrrell delivers a stand-up show that will have you laughing all night long. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Colum Tyrrell\nColum Tyrrell is an Irish stand-up comedian known for his sharp wit\, engaging storytelling\, and unique perspective on life. He has built a strong following through his relatable humor and has performed at comedy clubs and festivals across the US and internationally\, earning a reputation as one of the most exciting voices in comedy today. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp wit and engaging storytelling\nUnique Irish perspective on everyday life\nClever observational comedy\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacramento’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $32. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/colum-tyrrell-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95825
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/a/613/a181fc97-ad9f-4c29-a8b9-b216ee698613_RETINA_PORTRAIT_16_9.jpg
