SUMMARY:Jon Lovitz LIVE at Bethesda Theater
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJon Lovitz LIVE at Bethesda Theater\nComedy legend Jon Lovitz is bringing his hilarious stand-up act to the Bethesda Theater on August 16\, 2026. Known for his iconic characters and razor-sharp wit\, Lovitz delivers a night of non-stop laughs that fans of all ages will love. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM ET\nVenue: Bethesda Theater\nAddress: 7719 Wisconsin Ave\, Bethesda\, MD 20814\nPhone: (240) 330-4500\nAge Requirement: Check venue for details \nAbout Jon Lovitz\nJon Lovitz is a beloved comedian and actor best known for his years on Saturday Night Live\, where he created iconic characters like Tommy Flanagan the Pathological Liar and Master Thespian. He has appeared in dozens of films and TV shows and continues to tour as one of America’s most recognizable stand-up comedians. His sharp observational humor and impeccable timing make every show a memorable experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nClassic stand-up comedy from an SNL legend\nHilarious storytelling and character work\nSharp wit and observational humor\nCallbacks to beloved TV and film roles\nAn intimate theater setting for a premium comedy experience\nA night of non-stop laughter\n\nVenue Information\nBethesda Theater is a premier entertainment venue located at 7719 Wisconsin Ave in Bethesda\, MD\, offering excellent sightlines and a comfortable atmosphere for live comedy and performances. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $109. Secure your seats now — Jon Lovitz shows sell out fast! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
