SUMMARY:John Mulaney With Very Special Guest LIVE at Starlight Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout John Mulaney\nJohn Mulaney is a four-time Emmy Award-winning comedian\, writer\, and actor who has become one of the most beloved stand-up performers of his generation. Known for his impeccable timing\, storytelling brilliance\, and clean-yet-sharp comedy style\, Mulaney has sold out arenas across the country and earned rave reviews for his Netflix specials including New in Town\, The Comeback Kid\, Kid Gorgeous\, and Baby J. \nHis current Mister Whatever Tour has been met with universal acclaim\, with audiences and critics alike calling it some of his best work yet. Joining him for this special Kansas City performance are guests Mike Birbiglia and a very special guest to be announced. This is one of the most anticipated comedy events of 2026. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nShow: 7:30 PM\nGuests: Mike Birbiglia + Very Special Guest\nVenue: Starlight Theatre\, 4600 Starlight Rd\, Kansas City\, MO 64132\nTicket Prices: $55 – $150 \nAbout the Venue\nThe Starlight Theatre is Kansas City’s iconic outdoor amphitheater\, located at 4600 Starlight Road in Swope Park. With a capacity of approximately 8\,000 guests\, Starlight is one of the premier outdoor entertainment venues in the Midwest and has hosted some of the biggest names in entertainment for over 70 years. \nThe open-air setting creates a magical atmosphere for summer performances — there’s nothing quite like watching a world-class comedian under the stars. The venue offers reserved seating as well as lawn areas\, a full concessions operation\, and ample parking on-site. Arrive early to enjoy the beautiful park setting and grab food and drinks before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a rare opportunity to see John Mulaney perform at an outdoor amphitheater in Kansas City\, joined by the equally brilliant Mike Birbiglia and a very special guest. Expect a full evening of world-class stand-up comedy featuring multiple performers\, making this one of the most exciting comedy events of the year in Kansas City. \nThe show runs approximately 2 hours. Bring a light jacket as evenings in August can be cool at the outdoor venue. Lawn chairs and blankets are welcome in the lawn areas. This show is expected to sell out — secure your tickets early. \nTicket Information\nTicket Prices: $55 – $150 (plus fees)\nTickets are available through the official Starlight Theatre box office and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/john-mulaney-with-very-special-guest-live-at-starlight-theatre/
LOCATION:Starlight Theatre\, 4600 Starlight RD\, Kansas City\, MO\, 64132\, USA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ccd9ebe2-c301-4487-bbe4-5bd6be744b30_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2-ns2s4k.jpg
