SUMMARY:Elliott Brothers Comedy Block Party LIVE at The Miracle Theater
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nElliott Brothers Comedy Block Party LIVE at The Miracle Theater\nThe Elliott Brothers are bringing Comedy Block Party back to Downtown Inglewood at the legendary Miracle Theater! Hosted by the hilarious Chris Spencer\, this all-star comedy showcase promises a night of non-stop laughs in the heart of Inglewood. \nThis is a hometown celebration of comedy featuring an all-star lineup curated by the Elliott Brothers — don’t miss this special night! \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM) \nVenue: The Miracle Theater \nAddress: 226 S Market St\, Inglewood\, CA 90301 \nAge Requirement: Please check venue for age restrictions \nAbout Chris Spencer\nChris Spencer is a veteran stand-up comedian\, actor\, and writer best known for his work on The Wayans Bros.\, Def Comedy Jam\, and BET’s ComicView. With decades of experience in comedy\, Spencer brings sharp wit and relatable humor to every performance. \nAs host of Comedy Block Party\, he keeps the energy high and the laughs coming all night long. \nWhat to Expect\n\nAn all-star comedy lineup curated by the Elliott Brothers\nHosted by the legendary Chris Spencer\nA celebration of comedy in Downtown Inglewood\nLive stand-up performances from top comedians\nAn intimate\, high-energy show at The Miracle Theater\nA community event bringing comedy home to Inglewood\n\nVenue Information\nThe Miracle Theater is Inglewood’s independent stage for music\, comedy\, film\, and community events\, located at 226 S Market St in Downtown Inglewood. The venue blends a historic identity with a modern event experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $51. Secure your seats now before they sell out! \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
