SUMMARY:Drew Thomas LIVE at Brad Garrett's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nDrew Thomas LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nStand-up comedian Drew Thomas headlines Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club inside MGM Grand in Las Vegas on August 18\, 2026. Joined by Brad Garrett himself\, Drew brings his sharp observational humor and high-energy delivery to the Strip for a night of laughs you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, August 18\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109 (inside MGM Grand)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid photo ID\nParking: MGM Grand parking available \nAbout Drew Thomas\nDrew Thomas is a rising stand-up comedian known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and high-energy performances. He has toured extensively across the country and built a loyal following through his appearances at top comedy clubs and festivals. Drew’s comedy blends personal anecdotes with sharp cultural observations that resonate with audiences everywhere. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand-up set by Drew Thomas\nSpecial appearance by Brad Garrett\nIntimate showroom setting inside MGM Grand\nSharp\, observational stand-up comedy\n18+ show with adult humor\nBest available seating within purchased zone\n\nVenue Information\nBrad Garrett’s Comedy Club is located inside the MGM Grand Hotel & Casino on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering a premium comedy experience in an intimate setting with excellent sightlines and a lively atmosphere. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $86. Seating is best available within the zone purchased — seats are not assigned until arrival. There is an overall 8-ticket limit per order. All performers subject to change without notice. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
